WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.991
The first query shows the individual Laptop January
sale rows The

00:00:06.018 --> 00:00:11.877
second query sums them into one product-month value
That one total

00:00:11.903 --> 00:00:17.597
can be placed into a pivot cell But after
aggregation the individual

00:00:17.623 --> 00:00:23.155
sale IDs and amounts cannot be recovered from the
total alone This

00:00:23.168 --> 00:00:25.431
is the detail lost by aggregation
